\end{itemize}
No Semimi scripture or community organization was found.

\section{Digital and Audio Resources}
No audio, video or software resources were found. The Rosetta Panglossia entry is a catalogue stub: \url{https://rosettapanglossia.longnow.org/index.php?title=Etz}

\section{Curriculum Development Context}
Documentation is minimal. A native-language curriculum would first require fieldwork: documentation, a practical orthography, and community consultation. The available sources are only a basis for orientation.

