\end{itemize}

\section{Curriculum Development Context}
Basque has extensive institutional support and established Basque-medium schooling. The next step is to inventory the official curricula, the ikastola and publisher textbook series, and the Euskaltzaindia norms, none of which were directly retrieved here.

\end{document}
